      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wouldn't use it, as creating a custom AFK avatar has a lot less limitations than trying to get anything to loop with an IK that doesn't like anything else getting in the way. I'm trying to imagine anything overriding VR IK bones, let alone Full-body VR IK bones, and I think there are too many prerequisites. \n\nIf the solution to the IK being too high priority is just swapping meshes and every avatar suddenly has another mesh that it swaps, it's going to make things a lot worse than if you have some people willing to make a custom, high performance AFK avatar that they switch to.\n\nIt needs more thought and the IK needs fixing beforehand. I don't think this is good.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
